# Citation metadata (Citation File Format 1.2.0, https://citation-file-format.github.io/)
# GitHub renders this file as a "Cite this repository" button.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Veta, please cite the accompanying paper (preferred-citation below)
  and, if you need to refer to a specific code version, this repository.
type: software
title: "Veta: a GPU-resident direct numerical simulation solver for turbulent channel flow"
abstract: >-
  Direct numerical simulation of incompressible turbulent plane channel flow in
  CUDA Fortran: Fourier discretization in the two wall-parallel directions,
  Chebyshev (Shen-Galerkin) or banded finite differences in the wall-normal
  direction, the Kim-Moin-Moser velocity/wall-normal-vorticity formulation,
  a low-storage third-order Runge-Kutta/Crank-Nicolson time integrator, and a
  1-D slab decomposition with NCCL all-to-all transposes for multi-GPU runs.
authors:
